The kernel Bugzilla [1] currently lists 54 open [2] ALSA bugs.

Please review these bugs (some might as a first step require to ask the 
submitters whether they are still present in recent kernels).

For both these bugs and future bugs in the kernel Bugzilla, it would be 
good if someone would volunteer to review ALSA bugs in the kernel 
Bugzilla, and if they are actually bugs in ALSA (and not bugs in 
ACPI/PNP/... affecting ALSA drivers) ask the submitters to also file a 
bug in the ALSA bug tracking system leaving a pointer to the URL in the 
ALSA bug tracking system in the kernel Bugzilla.

TIA
